## Instructions
1. Read the tech spec and build log
2. Examine the project/ directory structure
3. Create a Dockerfile for each service (use multi-stage builds where beneficial)
4. Create a docker-compose.yml to orchestrate all services together
5. Add health checks to each service
6. Create a .env.example file with all required environment variables
7. Write all files to the project/ directory

Guidelines:
- Never hardcode secrets — use environment variables
- Use lightweight base images (alpine where possible)
- Set proper resource limits
- Include clear deployment_notes

## Output
Create a deploy-config.json with:
- Summary of deployment setup
- Service definitions (name, build context, ports, environment)
- Paths to Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml
- Environment variable documentation
- Any operational notes
